  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Completed all 143 reference Geometry overloads and 115 main-interface Load overloads, exposed through 120 managed Load overloads. Added 15 typed Output queries with named status/data results, immutable payloads and complete XML IntelliSense. Included the reviewed Root and wrapper APIs, updated usage guides and a semantic Load coverage audit. Validated 2,259 offline tests and 340 installed-package XML examples against managed stand-ins. Targets Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1; live STAAD compatibility and engineering validation remain pending. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
